---
// Do Less Work -> Three Rs Optimization Hierarchy: Reduce, Reuse, Recycle.
const W = 900;
const H = 290;
---
<figure class="ge8a">
  <div class="ge8a-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Optimization order of operations: first do less work or eliminate waste, then apply the Three Rs—Reduce allocations, Reuse caller buffers, and only finally Recycle via sync.Pool.">
      {/* 4 vertical tiers across 900px */}
      <rect x="14" y="16" width="206" height="258" rx="10" class="ge8a-card is-ok" />
      <text x="28" y="42" class="ge8a-b-ok">0. Do Less Work</text>
      <text x="28" y="64" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Biggest win at zero GC cost:</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hiệu quả nhất, 0 tốn công GC:</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x="28" y="78" width="178" height="72" rx="6" class="ge8a-box" />
      <text x="38" y="98" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Tailored single-char</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Tách dòng đơn '\n' thay</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="114" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>  scan vs bytes.Split</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>  cho bytes.Split đa năng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="132" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Skip unused Debug</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Bỏ log Debug &amp; base check</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="28" y="176" class="ge8a-b">Best latency return:</text>
      <text x="28" y="196" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Remove work completely before</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bớt việc dư thừa trước rồi mới</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="28" y="212" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>optimizing how it allocates.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>tính tới chuyện tối ưu bộ nhớ.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="236" y="16" width="206" height="258" rx="10" class="ge8a-card is-ok" />
      <text x="250" y="42" class="ge8a-b-ok">1. Reduce Allocs</text>
      <text x="250" y="64" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Cut unnecessary heap objects:</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Giảm hẳn số lần xin heap:</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x="250" y="78" width="178" height="72" rx="6" class="ge8a-box" />
      <text x="260" y="98" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Parse []byte directly</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Parse thẳng trên []byte</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="260" y="114" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>  instead of string(b)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>  khỏi ép sang string(b)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="260" y="132" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Pre-size make([]T, 0, N)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Đặt sẵn cap: make([]T, 0, N)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="250" y="176" class="ge8a-b">Safe &amp; idiomatic:</text>
      <text x="250" y="196" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Often makes code simpler and</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Thường làm code gọn dễ đọc</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="250" y="212" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>lighter on CPU caches too.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>và đỡ làm bẩn CPU cache.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="458" y="16" width="206" height="258" rx="10" class="ge8a-card" />
      <text x="472" y="42" class="ge8a-b">2. Reuse Buffers</text>
      <text x="472" y="64" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Keep 1 caller-owned scratch:</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tái sử dụng 1 buffer cố định:</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x="472" y="78" width="178" height="72" rx="6" class="ge8a-box" />
      <text x="482" y="98" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Pass buf []byte down</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Truyền buf []byte xuống</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="482" y="114" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>  via io.Reader / Reset()</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>  hoặc gọi b.Reset() giữ cap</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="482" y="132" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Bounded 8 KB sliding</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Chặn trần RAM cố định 8 KB</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="472" y="176" class="ge8a-b">Mind the over-sizing trap:</text>
      <text x="472" y="196" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Zeroing stale slice tails or</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nhớ Reset/clear() phần đuôi kẻo</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="472" y="212" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>pinning peak 64 MB forever.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>ôm mảng 64 MB mãi không nhả.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="680" y="16" width="206" height="258" rx="10" class="ge8a-card is-red" />
      <text x="694" y="42" class="ge8a-b-red">3. Recycle (sync.Pool)</text>
      <text x="694" y="64" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Last resort for multi-G reuse:</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ dùng cuối cùng khi cần:</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x="694" y="78" width="178" height="72" rx="6" class="ge8a-box" />
      <text x="704" y="98" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Many parallel goroutines</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Nhiều goroutine song song</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="704" y="114" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Identical scratch blocks</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Xin/trả liên tục trong 1 GC</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="704" y="132" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Always Reset before Put</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Phải Reset trước khi Put</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="694" y="176" class="ge8a-b-red">Do NOT overuse sync.Pool:</text>
      <text x="694" y="196" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Can increase peak HeapInuse</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Có thể làm peak heap cao hơn</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="694" y="212" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>vs simple local static buffers.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>so với để GC dọn buffer đơn giản.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Apply optimization patterns left-to-right: eliminating pointless work and reducing heap allocations solves 90% of bottlenecks cleanly; reserve sync.Pool strictly for proven high-churn multi-goroutine pools.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Đi đúng thứ tự từ trái sang phải: bỏ bớt việc thừa (Do Less Work) rồi Reduce allocation giải quyết sạch gần hết ca chậm; chỉ đụng tới sync.Pool sau cùng khi đo thấy hiệu quả thật trên tải đa luồng.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ge8a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ge8a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ge8a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ge8a text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ge8a-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ge8a-card.is-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .ge8a-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge8a-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge8a-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.1; }
  .ge8a-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 13px; }
  .ge8a-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); font-size: 13px; }
  .ge8a-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); font-size: 13px; }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge8a-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge8a-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .ge8a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
